    {
      "id": "Tilt your device to move around the map.\nHead for the exit tile to progress to the next level.",
      "note": "Tutorial lesson 1, shown in the bottom bar (two lines, up to about 85 characters a line)",
      "max": 170
    },
    {
      "id": "Stepping on this tile will reverse the controls.\nStep on another and they go back to normal.",
      "note": "Tutorial lesson 2",
      "max": 170
    },
    {
      "id": "Stepping on this tile will make Map Man disappear.\nDon't worry after a few moves he will show up again.",
      "note": "Tutorial lesson 3",
      "max": 170
    },
    {
      "id": "Stepping on this tile will cause Map Man to get stuck.\nShake your device to free him and get moving again.",
      "note": "Tutorial lesson 4",
      "max": 170
    },
    {
      "id": "Watch out for bonus points,\n although you may have to go out of your way to get them",
      "note": "Tutorial lesson 5",
      "max": 170
    },
    {
      "id": "Also keep an eye out for extra lives,\nbut take care as they will take you\neven more off course than bonus points",
      "note": "Tutorial lesson 6",
      "max": 170
    },
    {
      "id": "Be careful of the poison tiles, if you step on them you will lose a life.",
      "note": "Tutorial lesson 7",
      "max": 170
    },
    {
      "id": "These tiles will give you extra time or cost you time. You will get bonus points for time left on the clock when you finish each level.",
      "note": "Tutorial lesson 8",
      "max": 170
    },
    {
      "id": "These tiles cause other tiles to disappear and reappear. When the tiles are hidden you can still step on them so remember where they are.",
      "note": "Tutorial lesson 9",
      "max": 170
    },
    {
      "id": "Every so often you'll come across a checkpoint. Each time you reach a checkpoint you can restart from there instead of going back to the beginning.",
      "note": "Tutorial lesson 10",
      "max": 170
    },
    {
      "id": "If you need a break from playing, tap the screen during play to pause. Once paused you can either resume play or exit the game.",
      "note": "Tutorial lesson 11",
      "max": 170
    },
    {
      "id": "You're all set, head for the exit to start the game. Have fun!",
      "note": "Tutorial lesson 12",
      "max": 170
    }
